From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LockPlus Vendor <vendor@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:07:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] W13: ship only the WireGuardKitGo C interface

LockPlus links libwg-go through WireGuardKitGo only; the Swift WireGuardKit target (and WireGuardKitC, used only by
it) had no consumer after W11. Their sources are removed so they can be neither built nor linked.
